                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Ideally you'd use a tmpfile()-like API to create unique files for each test execution.  This works as-is but it is still not ideal if we run tests outside of Docker (which naturally create a separate /tmp per container) because two independent Jenkins jobs could end up colliding.\n\nYou could also do something like `+ std::to_string(std::this_thread::thread_id())`"
                },
